yup 0.0.2 Yupana Straight Line Spreadsheet Format
sheet	row	col	type	cell	format
Sizes	*	*	|		columnwidth=12
Sizes	*	*	-		rowheight=18
Sizes	*	1	|		columnwidth=30
Sizes	1	1	$	Every column 12 wide and every row 18 high	
Sizes	2	1	$	Except column A at 30	
Sizes	3	*	-		rowheight=6
Sizes	4	1	$	Row 3 is 6 high and row 5 hidden	
Sizes	5	*	-		rowheight=0
Sizes	5	1	$	Hidden	
Sizes	5	2	#	5	
Sizes	*	3	|		columnwidth=0
Sizes	6	1	$	Column C is hidden	
Sizes	6	3	#	3	
Sizes	7	1	$	The tallest row	
Sizes	7	*	-		rowheight=409
Sizes	8	1	$	B8 is blank but formatted	
Sizes	8	2	.		numberformat=0.00
Sizes	9	1	$	The sum of the two hidden numbers	
Sizes	9	2	=	B5+C6	numberformat=0.00
Only sizes	*	2	|		columnwidth=4.5
Only sizes	2	*	-		rowheight=30
